# Act I objectives for tools/playthrough/playthrough.py (spec:
# specs/tools/playthrough.md). Crude: pokes (warp, spawn, pos, stat) jump
# between milestones instead of walking; each milestone is its own
# state-dump run. Ids from the 1.14d tables (levels.txt rows, monstats
# rows, objects.txt rows): Blood Moor 2, Cold Plains 3, Stony Field 4,
# Den of Evil 8, Burial Grounds 17, Tower Cellar 5 = 25, Barracks 28,
# Catacombs 4 = 37, Tristram 38, Lut Gholein 40; Akara 148, Kashya 150,
# Charsi 154, Gheed 147, Warriv 155, Zombie 5, Andariel 156,
# Blood Raven 267, Griswold 365, The Smith 402, Countess base class 45;
# waypoint object 119, cairn stones 17-22.
# Quests (specs/world/quests.md §1.9; done = bit 0 of the slot): Den of
# Evil slot 1 (Akara msg 76 with 1.1), Andariel slot 6 (Warriv msg 183
# with 6.1), Act I completed slot 7 (Warriv's travel to Lut Gholein with
# 6.0). The three quest milestones need an NPC talk, which the headless
# input cannot do yet (no hover pick, playthrough.md Open question 3):
# expected blockers with the quest bit clear.
playthrough 1
act 1

save ama --name PtAma --class ama --expansion
save sor --name PtSor --class sor --expansion --level 30 --skill 8=20 --right-skill 44 --stat 8=128000 --stat 9=128000 --waypoints all --quests acts=1
save den --name PtDen --class ama --expansion --quests 1.1
save andy --name PtAndy --class sor --expansion --level 30 --waypoints all --quests 6.1
save east --name PtEast --class sor --expansion --level 30 --waypoints all --quests 6.0

milestone town-start
  use ama
  deadline 40
  note Akara (148) is left out: her tent is outside the start's active rooms (unverified on 1.14d)
  need player lv == 1
  need unit ut 1 cl 150 present
  need unit ut 1 cl 154 present
  need unit ut 1 cl 147 present
  need unit ut 1 cl 155 present

milestone town-walk
  use ama
  deadline 60
  input frame 10; click 600 300
  need player lv == 1
  need player moved >= 5
  need player m == 5

milestone blood-moor
  use ama
  deadline 80
  poke 5 warp 2
  need player lv == 2
  need unit ut 1 lv 2 count >= 3

milestone kill-zombie
  use sor
  deadline 150
  poke 5 warp 2
  poke 30 spawn 5 @x+3 @y normal
  input frame 40; rclick 450 300
  need unit ut 1 g @p1 dead

milestone den-of-evil
  use ama
  deadline 80
  poke 5 warp 8
  need player lv == 8
  need unit ut 1 lv 8 count >= 5

milestone den-of-evil-done
  use den
  deadline 1000
  sweep 20 2 100 20
  find ut 1 cl 148
  poke +2 pos @1:148 @x+3 @y
  poke +25 msg 0x30 @1:148
  input frame +9; move 448 324; frame +10; click 448 324; frame +40; click 448 324
  note save with 1.1 (Den cleared, reward pending); talking to Akara (msg 76) sets 1.0. The cursor hovers the point a frame before each click (scenario-diff §2 r4.5: a press in the pass of its move is a point click). The first click picks Akara (player x+3) and plays her intro (m 0, her text list sorts string 0 first); C->S 0x30 ends the chat (the headless run has no menu to close), the second click gets the quest message
  need ever quest 1 1 set
  need ever quest 1 0 set

milestone cold-plains-wp
  use ama
  deadline 80
  poke 5 warp 3
  need player lv == 3
  need unit ut 2 cl 119 lv 3 present

milestone burial-grounds
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 17
  sweep 20 2 400 40
  need ever player lv == 17
  need unit ut 1 cl 267 lv 17 seen

milestone stony-field-cairn
  use ama
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 4
  sweep 20 2 400 40
  need ever player lv == 4
  need unit ut 2 cl 17,18,19,20,21 lv 4 seen

milestone tristram
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 38
  sweep 20 2 400 40
  need ever player lv == 38
  need unit ut 1 cl 365 lv 38 seen

milestone countess
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 25
  sweep 20 2 300 30 grid
  need ever player lv == 25
  need unit ut 1 cl 45 lv 25 seen

milestone smith
  use sor
  deadline 80
  poke 5 warp 28
  need player lv == 28
  need unit ut 1 cl 402 present

milestone andariel-present
  use sor
  deadline 80
  poke 5 warp 37
  need player lv == 37
  need unit ut 1 cl 156 present

milestone andariel-killed
  use sor
  deadline 200
  poke 5 warp 37
  poke 20 goto unit 156
  poke 30 pos @1:156 @x+2 @y
  poke 30 stat @1:156 6 0 256
  poke 40 missile 58 @x @y @x+2 @y skill 36 1
  note the headless right click walks instead of casting (spec Open question 2): a Fire Bolt missile poke
  note goto first: at the warp spot @x+3 is wall (collision 0x5), Andariel placed there was out of the bolt's reach (q-fix-boss-damage)
  need ever unit ut 1 cl 156 killed
  need unit ut 1 cl 156 dead

milestone andariel-done
  use andy
  deadline 200
  poke 5 pos @1:155 @x+3 @y
  poke 25 msg 0x30 @1:155
  input frame 9; move 448 324; frame 10; click 448 324; frame 40; click 448 324
  note save with 6.1 (Andariel dead, reward pending); talking to Warriv (msg 183) sets 6.0. The cursor hovers the point a frame before each click (scenario-diff §2 r4.5: a press in the pass of its move is a point click). The first click picks Warriv (player x+3) and plays his intro (m 0); C->S 0x30 ends the chat, the second click gets msg 183
  need unit ut 1 cl 155 present
  need ever quest 6 0 set

milestone act2-open
  use east
  deadline 300
  poke 5 pos @1:155 @x+3 @y
  poke 14 msg 0x38 0 @1:155 1
  input frame 9; move 448 324; frame 10; click 448 324
  note save with 6.0; Warriv's travel ("Go east", world/npc.md §8.3) moves the player to Lut Gholein (40) and sets 7.0, 7.13. The cursor hovers the point a frame before each click (scenario-diff §2 r4.5: a press in the pass of its move is a point click). The click picks Warriv and opens the chat; the headless run has no menu, so C->S 0x38 (action 0, item 1: the menu's travel intent, ui/panels/npc.rs option_intent) stands for the menu pick
  need ever player act == 1
  need ever player lv == 40
  need ever quest 7 0 set

milestone to-act2
  use sor
  deadline 100
  poke 5 warp 40
  need player lv == 40
  need player act == 1
